{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuffles 'n Scuffles is a strategic roguelike deck-builder set in a whimsical cardboard cutout world. Face off against dangerous enemies, encounter quirky characters, and redefine the cards in your handcrafted deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, allocate mana to the cards in your hand to activate and use their abilities. Spend your mana wisely, your cards remember the mana you give them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the shop to add new cards to your deck; cards are worth more than the sum of their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop by the carnival and give the Wheel of Fortune a spin\u2014it's a guaranteed way to thin out your deck! Perhaps a bit more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Card Altar lets you modify the cards in your deck and tweak their wording to transform their effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the curtain falls on this three-act play, how will your story end? Will you break free, or remain trapped in the loop? In this improvised world, your ability to rewrite your cards may be your only way out. So ask yourself... who is <i>really</i> pulling the strings? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719450?t=1768868350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/ef765bc45bccca6e09a8d0c34eca612091d635ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768868350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/3b1051a9ba8ad5181d8801905b062715c3692e1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768868350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/3b1051a9ba8ad5181d8801905b062715c3692e1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768868350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3787680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuffles 'n Scuffles is a strategic roguelike deck-builder set in a whimsical cardboard cutout world. Face off against dangerous enemies, encounter quirky characters, and redefine the cards in your handcrafted deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, allocate mana to the cards in your hand to activate and use their abilities. Spend your mana wisely, your cards remember the mana you give them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/25aaf49f91fc0e3706164a1de8f0636f.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the shop to add new cards to your deck; cards are worth more than the sum of their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/b33ca11ce6bae0294b3548359a9b02ea.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop by the carnival and give the Wheel of Fortune a spin\u2014it's a guaranteed way to thin out your deck! Perhaps a bit more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/5e3062c3d348924ebe70373fb0023c10.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Card Altar lets you modify the cards in your deck and tweak their wording to transform their effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.poster.avif?t=1768868350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.webm?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/extras/88fb20963bf00f450defc2902d4d404e.mp4?t=1768868350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the curtain falls on this three-act play, how will your story end? Will you break free, or remain trapped in the loop? In this improvised world, your ability to rewrite your cards may be your only way out. So ask yourself... who is <i>really</i> pulling the strings? </p>","developers":["Sour Circuit Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719450/b0bc0b4e9768e6a8be1f85243330f5d85dfd1077/header.jpg?t=1768868350","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-4000M Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae HD Graphics 4600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3719450/1255274139/4cc3e4e9cb2da7d5a7c70516e8732761b3e430bb/1760394648/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760395510","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3719450/1255274139/4cc3e4e9cb2da7d5a7c70516e8732761b3e430bb/1760394648/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760395510","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3719450/1255274139/4cc3e4e9cb2da7d5a7c70516e8732761b3e430bb/1760394648/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760395510","id":257217452,"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite